# Build-context exclusions for the GourMate backend image.
#
# Applied by fly.toml via `[build] ignorefile = "backend/.dockerignore"` while
# the Docker context is the repository root, so patterns are written to match
# at any depth (`**/`). They also remain valid for a context-rooted build.

# Python bytecode / caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/*.egg-info/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
**/venv/

# Secrets / local env — never ship, but keep the documented template
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Tests & dev tooling
**/tests/
**/test/
**/conftest.py
**/pytest.ini
**/tox.ini
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/

# Tooling / VCS / docs
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
